{
  "vars": {
    "common_consumables": {
      "disabled": null,
      "escha_items": [
        "Silt Pouch",
        "Bead Pouch",
        "Frayed Sack (Pel)",
        "Frayed Sack (Fer)",
        "Frayed Sack (Tau)"
      ],
      "unm_items": [
        "Arke's Coffer",
        "Bakunawa's Coffer",
        "Belinda's Coffer",
        "Clawberry's Coffer",
        "Harold's Coffer",
        "Shedu's Coffer",
        "Sovereign's Coffer",
        "Vedrfolnir's Coffer"
      ],
      "woe_items": [
        "Frayed Sack (D)",
        "Frayed Sack (L)",
        "Frayed Pouch (A)",
        "Frayed Pouch (B)",
        "Frayed Pouch (D)",
        "Frayed Pouch (G)",
        "Frayed Pouch (R)"
      ]
    }
  },
  "actions": [
    {
      "when": [
        "not vars.common_consumables.disabled",
        "freeInventorySlots() > 0",
        "  (not vars.common_consumables.escha_items_disabled and canUseItem(vars.common_consumables.escha_items)) or \\",
        "  (not vars.common_consumables.unm_items_disabled and canUseItem(vars.common_consumables.unm_items)) or \\",
        "  (not vars.common_consumables.woe_items_disabled and canUseItem(vars.common_consumables.woe_items))"
      ],
      "commands": ["useItem(me)"],
      "miss_frequency": 30,
      "scope": "battle",
      "comment": [
        "The postpone function will always return nil. By placing it at the end of the OR sequence,",
        "we guarantee it will only be run if none of the other conditions are met. In that case, it will",
        "prevent the gambit from being checked again for a given amount of time (30 seconds) without changing",
        "the false result of the when condition."
      ]
    }
  ]
}
